From: Codex <codex@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] gpio: expose GPIO_SYSFS without EXPERT

The generic 6.12 config requests CONFIG_GPIO_SYSFS=y, but its Kconfig
prompt is hidden unless EXPERT is enabled. Keep EXPERT disabled and make
the deprecated sysfs option visible so the existing config can select it.

---
 drivers/gpio/Kconfig | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpio/Kconfig b/drivers/gpio/Kconfig
--- a/drivers/gpio/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/gpio/Kconfig
@@ -62 +62 @@
-	bool "/sys/class/gpio/... (sysfs interface)" if EXPERT
+	bool "/sys/class/gpio/... (sysfs interface)"
*** End Patch
